      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "魔石には「魔石の欠片」「魔石」「魔石の結晶」があり\r\nより強い力を引き出すためには、上位の魔石が必要になります。\r\n\r\n宝箱や特殊なエネミー討伐、クエスト報酬などで\r\n世界中に散らばる魔石を集め\r\nビジョンの真の力を引き出しましょう。",
        "official_en": "Magicite comes in three sizes: Magicite Shards,\r\nMagicites, and Magicite Crysts. Larger pieces of\r\nmagicite are required to draw out stronger powers.\r\n\r\nGather magicite from treasure chests, by defeating\r\nunique enemies, or by completing quests, and unlock\r\nthe true power of your visions.",
        "real_en": null
      },
